# Architecture

This is a right-sized layered architecture, not a maximal one — see
[Why not more layers](#why-not-more-layers) at the bottom for the
reasoning behind where the line is drawn. If you're new to this
codebase, read this file first; it should let you find any given piece
of behavior without reading the whole project.

> Adapted from the `iOSAppStarterKit` starter kit. Sections marked
> `[FILL IN]` are placeholders — the *shape* (Domain/Data/Presentation,
> the composition root, the baseline feature set below) is what's meant
> to carry over as-is; the specific types/protocols/decisions inside
> each section are illustrative examples and need to be re-decided for
> this app, not copied blind.

